# Group calls in a fight with the player's group (kind combat, /group). The code picks the topic at the
# matching moment: a pull, an add, out of power, low health, a big heal, mez and mez broken, root, stun,
# taunt, a kill, a wipe, the rest after a fight, and a rez. Keep each topic strictly about its moment.
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices/TALKING-UPDATE-CONTENT.md).

# ---- pull: the bot pulls, or sees the pull coming -----------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic pull
@who *
@needs in_player_group
incoming
inc, get ready
pulling, get set
here it comes
pull on the way
one coming, on me
inc 1
heads up, pull inc
ready? pulling now
bringing it in
@who Daredevil
pulling the big one, trust me
@who Leveler

# ---- add: another monster joined ----------------------------------------------------------
@kind combat
@topic add
@who *
@needs in_player_group
add, add
got an add
add inc
we have an add
another one, add!
add, someone grab it
two now, careful
add, mez it if you can
extra coming in
@who Daredevil
add, we can take it

