# The talking update audit: only a power user rests for power
@kind combat
@topic rest
@who *
@realm *
@class Wizard,Theurgist,Sorcerer,Cabalist,Necromancer,Cleric,Friar,Minstrel,Healer,Shaman,Runemaster,Spiritmaster,Bonedancer,Skald,Eldritch,Enchanter,Mentalist,Animist,Druid,Bard,Warden
@levels 1-50
@needs in_player_group
need power, sitting

# ---- displaced_heal: an encounter threw or ported a raider of the party (1.2, EncounterDisplacementRecovery) ----------
