# ---- epic mechanics (1.2, epic wave 2: EpicEncounterTactics dungeon rules) ----------------------------------------
# A gamebot of the real player's party calls the boss's mechanic as the raid plays it: once per topic per party every
# 45 s. {boss} is the boss, {target} the other one the call is about (the partner, the add, the raider). Keep each topic
# about its moment.

# ---- epic_twin_heal: King Tuscar heals off Queen Kula's damage, so only his tank hits him ---------------------------
